    <author>Domestique Library</author>
    <name>VO2max 6x3min (60min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 14min from 50% to 75% FTP | Intervals: 6 x (3min @ 110% / 3min @ 55%) | Cooldown: 9min 30s from 55% to 45% FTP</description>
